 "spellcooldown_individual_spell": "%1 (%2 sec. cooldown)",
 "spellcooldown_lenshelp": "<p>In this section the cooldown of a spell is displayed, hence for how long your character is unable to use a certain spell or spell group.</p>\n<p>When a spell has been cast, this spell and the spell groups it belongs to have a cooldown for a given amount of time. The cooldown the casting of a spell causes for its spell groups does not necessarily have the same length as the cooldown of the spell itself.</p>\n<p>The icons for the 4 spell groups are constantly displayed, however they are greyed out as long as there is no cooldown active. Single spells are only shown while their cooldown lasts. To hide this bar completely, please uncheck the corresponding box under Options->General.</p>\n<p>For more information on spells please take a look at the manual.</p>",
 "spellcooldown_lenshelp_caption": "Cooldown Bar",
