 "spelllist_tooltip_spell_mana_soulpoints": "Mana / Soul Points",
 "spelllistwidget_lenshelp": "<p>The spell list contains detailed information about all spells. By clicking on <img src='/images/skin/classic/button-contextmenu-12x12-idle.png'>, you can select various criteria (e.g. vocation or spell group) which define which spells should be displayed.</p>\n<p>You can directly \"drag&drop\" spells from the spell list into the action bar, provided it is not locked. If assigned to an action button, you can cast a spell by clicking on this button or the assigned hotkey.  If the assigned spell requires a certain parameter (such as \"up/down\" or a name), a dialog will open up which allows you to specify it.</p>\n          ",
 "spelllistwidget_lenshelp_caption": "Spell List",
 "spelllistwidget_show_more": "Show More"
